add('voice',10, 'Draft a short team note about an unsuccessful experiment. Facts: New reminder subject line produced 41 opens out of 100; old line 44 out of 100. No statistical analysis done. Team will retain old line for now and test a different send time next week. Tone: candid, interested, no triumph or blame.', ['Exact counts.', 'No claim of statistical significance.', 'Old line retained for now; send-time test next week.'], [('Did the test prove the old line is better?', 'No statistical analysis was done; observed opens were 44 versus 41.')], failures=['Calls result a decisive win or failure.', 'Invents causal explanation.'])

